WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:00.667
Oregon

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.368
Law enforcement

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:02.769
officials say a man accused

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:04.437
of torturing a woman

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:07.173
is using dating apps to avoid police.

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:09.476
A massive manhunt is now underway

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:11.411
after police found a victim last week.

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:12.846
They believe he bound

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:14.581
and beat unconscious.

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.616
CNN's Lucy Kavanagh has details,

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:17.817
new details

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:21.121
on this very disturbing story.

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:22.288
In Southern Oregon.

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:23.923
A manhunt is underway

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:25.091
for 36 year old

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.727
Benjamin Obadiah Foster on the run

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.195
after allegedly kidnaping

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:30.764
and trying to kill a woman

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:32.899
beating her into unconsciousness.

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:34.501
Police describing him

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.503
as an extremely dangerous suspect

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:37.203
who may attempt

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.238
to change his appearance

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:39.939
by shaving his beard and hair

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:41.775
or by changing his hair color.

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:43.109
The public being asked to pay

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:44.277
particular attention

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.413
to Foster's facial structure and eyes,

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:48.281
since those features are very difficult

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:49.282
to change.

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:50.083
Court documents

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:50.784
allege Foster

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:52.052
tried to kill the victim

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:53.853
while intentionally torturing her

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:54.487
and secretly

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:55.922
confining her in a place

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:58.291
where she was not likely to be found.

00:00:58.291 --> 00:00:59.826
Police say the victim was discovered

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:02.028
last Tuesday in Grant's Pass, Oregon,

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:03.963
bound and severely beaten.

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:06.332
Now hospitalized in critical condition.

00:01:06.466 --> 00:01:08.468
The suspect fleeing the scene.

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:09.469
I think he is

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:11.404
definitely a threat to others,

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:13.006
but I think he would be a threat

00:01:13.006 --> 00:01:15.775
to somebody who might be friend town.

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:16.709
I don't think

00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:18.511
he is

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:21.347
a random attacker, but I can.

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:22.682
Nothing's off the table

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:24.417
with an individual like him.

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:26.319
It was an absolutely disgusting scene.

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:27.720
Horrific scene.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:28.922
I seen a lot of my career.

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:31.558
But some things do stick with you.

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:33.159
And this will

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:35.395
this will stay stained in my memory

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:36.563
for many years to come.

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:37.864
On Thursday, local, state

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:38.865
and federal authorities

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:40.667
raided a property about 20 miles

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:41.968
north of Grant's Pass,

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:43.136
where they seized evidence,

00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:45.905
including Foster's 2008 Nissan Sentra.

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:47.307
During that search, police

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:49.375
arrested a 68 year old woman

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:51.244
for hindering prosecution

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:53.012
and allegedly helping foster

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:54.447
evade law enforcement.

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:54.981
Police say

00:01:54.981 --> 00:01:56.549
Foster evaded capture

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:57.984
and likely received assistance

00:01:57.984 --> 00:01:59.219
in fleeing the area

00:01:59.219 --> 00:01:59.819
and believe

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:01.321
he is actively using online

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:02.322
dating applications

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:04.624
to contact unsuspecting individuals

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:05.592
who may be lured

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:06.392
into assisting

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:07.627
with the suspect's escape

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:09.929
or potentially as additional victims.

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:11.264
This isn't Foster's

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:12.866
first run-In with the law.

00:02:12.866 --> 00:02:13.800
Court records show

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:16.069
he was charged in two separate cases

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:17.937
accusing him of attacking women

00:02:17.937 --> 00:02:20.173
while living in Las Vegas years earlier.

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:21.141
In the first case,

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:22.041
Foster was charged

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:23.076
with a felony battery

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:25.111
constituting domestic violence.

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:26.012
His ex-girlfriend

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:27.413
testified that he had attempted

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:28.281
to strangle her

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:30.049
in a rage in 2017

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:31.885
after another man texted her.

00:02:31.885 --> 00:02:33.486
He's a felon on the run.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.388
He doesn't want to go back to prison.

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:37.023
He's probably willing to do anything

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:38.224
to stay out of prison.

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:39.692
While that case was still pending

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:41.294
in court in 2019.

00:02:41.294 --> 00:02:42.362
Foster was charged

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:44.130
with felony assault, battery

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:45.965
and kidnaping for allegedly attacking

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:48.101
another woman his girlfriend at the time.

00:02:48.134 --> 00:02:48.902
The victim told

00:02:48.902 --> 00:02:49.302
police

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:50.503
Foster strangled her

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:51.905
to the point of unconsciousness

00:02:51.905 --> 00:02:53.072
several times

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:54.107
and kept her tied up

00:02:54.107 --> 00:02:56.075
for most of the next two weeks.

00:02:56.075 --> 00:02:57.110
Court records show

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.344
she said she escaped

00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:00.613
after convincing Foster to go shopping.

00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:02.949
Foster ultimately agreed to plea deals

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:04.450
sentenced to a maximum

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.052
of 30 months in prison.

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:08.788
But given credit for the 729 days

00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:10.390
served in the first case

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:12.091
the police chief in Grande's past

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:13.393
Oregon expressing

00:03:13.393 --> 00:03:15.295
concern that he was set free.

00:03:15.295 --> 00:03:16.596
My response to that question

00:03:16.596 --> 00:03:17.730
is that am

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.633
I troubled by what I know already?

00:03:20.667 --> 00:03:22.068
The answer is yes.

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:24.504
We're laser focused on capturing this man

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:26.072
and bringing him to justice.

00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:30.343
The grants pass police chief

00:03:30.343 --> 00:03:32.445
also told me that the Oregon victim

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:34.214
and the suspect had a prior relationship.

00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:35.215
They knew one another.

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:35.982
He said

00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:36.983
she was only found

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:38.251
because a friend was worried

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:39.886
about not having heard from her,

00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:40.853
went to the house,

00:03:40.853 --> 00:03:43.056
discovered her tied up and unconscious.

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:44.991
This friend contacted the police

00:03:44.991 --> 00:03:46.559
and was able to immediately identify

00:03:46.559 --> 00:03:48.328
the suspect as Benjamin Foster.

00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:48.962
The chief

00:03:48.962 --> 00:03:50.196
also telling me he believes

00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:51.631
that Foster is a threat

00:03:51.631 --> 00:03:53.399
to others who might befriend him,

00:03:53.399 --> 00:03:55.568
that he is not a random attacker.

00:03:55.568 --> 00:03:56.536
But added, quote,

00:03:56.536 --> 00:03:57.604
Nothing's off the table

00:03:57.604 --> 00:03:59.372
with an individual like him Wolf.

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:00.506
Horrible deed.

00:04:00.506 --> 00:04:01.441
Lucy Cavanaugh, thank

00:04:01.441 --> 00:04:02.475
you very, very much.

